{"id":2286,"date":"2024-09-19T12:33:23","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:33:23","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2286"},"modified":"2025-10-03T13:27:29","modified_gmt":"2025-10-03T13:27:29","slug":"cardboard-sleeve-packaging","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-sleeve-packaging\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Sleeve Packaging"},"content":{"rendered":"<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full\" dir=\"auto\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-18\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\">\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto py-5 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto flex max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 group\/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"group\/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\n<div class=\"relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"898ae683-dd19-447d-99f3-c308e4e93887\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark\">\n<h1 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"61\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"61\">Custom Cardboard Sleeve Packaging for Branding<\/strong><\/h1>\n<p data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"353\">Cardboard sleeve packaging offers a sleek and cost-effective way to elevate your product\u2019s visual appeal while keeping your packaging compact. Whether you&#8217;re bundling a box, wrapping a tray, or branding a plain container, sleeves give you the flexibility to display your message with style.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"656\">At <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><em data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"380\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/a>, we produce <strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"430\">custom cardboard sleeve packaging<\/strong> at wholesale prices with full-color printing, precise sizing, and optional cutouts. You can design the sleeve to wrap tightly around your product or use it as a slip-on branding tool for boxes, jars, trays, or retail bundles.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"658\" data-end=\"921\">We offer quick turnaround times, free design assistance, and a wide selection of coating and finishing options including matte, gloss, and Spot UV. Our sleeves are shipped flat for easy storage and quick assembly\u2014perfect for manual or automated packing processes.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"926\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"966\">Benefits of Using Cardboard Sleeves<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1006\">Simple, Flexible, and Eye-Catching<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1214\">Cardboard sleeves are a minimal yet effective solution when you want product visibility without covering the entire item. They&#8217;re perfect for product labeling, gifting, food trays, or promotional packaging.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1397\">\n<li data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1260\">\n<p data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1260\">Easy to apply on rigid and folding boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1304\">\n<p data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1304\">Reduces packaging cost and material use<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1350\">\n<p data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1350\">Allows front-facing branding or messaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1397\">\n<p data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1397\">Helps keep product groups bundled together<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1500\">You can also add QR codes, nutritional panels, barcodes, and logos without printing on the inner box.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1505\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1550\">Cardboard Presentation Boxes and Sleeves<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1724\">Cardboard sleeves are often paired with <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-presentation-boxes\/\"><strong data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1624\">Cardboard Presentation Boxes<\/strong><\/a> to create professional, display-ready packaging for retail shelves or direct-to-customer shipments.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1765\">How Sleeves Improve Product Display<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1991\">Whether you&#8217;re offering candles, skincare, chocolates, or electronics, sleeves give your packaging a clean appearance with more branding space. They wrap securely around the product box and are easy to remove without damage.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2034\">This solution is also commonly used with:<\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2181\">\n<li data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2068\">\n<p data-start=\"2039\" data-end=\"2068\">Gift and subscription boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2094\">\n<p data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2094\">Retail display boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2095\" data-end=\"2130\">\n<p data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2130\">Mailer and e-commerce packages<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2131\" data-end=\"2181\">\n<p data-start=\"2134\" data-end=\"2181\">Bulk food trays or fast-moving consumer goods<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"2183\" data-end=\"2298\">When combined with window cutouts, sleeves let customers view the product while maintaining structure and branding.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"2300\" data-end=\"2303\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"2305\" data-end=\"2353\">Cardboard Sleeve Packaging Wholesale Features<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2564\">Our <strong data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2399\">cardboard sleeve packaging wholesale<\/strong> services are designed to support growing brands, small businesses, and enterprise-level companies. We maintain quality across all volumes and help you scale easily.<\/p>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"4859\">\n<thead data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2850\">\n<tr data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2850\">\n<th data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2591\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Features<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2669\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2604\">Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2669\" data-end=\"2717\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2691\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2750\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"2719\" data-end=\"2740\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2800\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2752\" data-end=\"2774\">Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2850\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"2802\" data-end=\"2823\">Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"4859\">\n<tr data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3423\">\n<td data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3165\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3155\">Dimensions<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3165\" data-end=\"3243\">Fully custom width, height, and wrap-around size<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3243\" data-end=\"3291\">Kraft, White SBS, Recycled Cardboard<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3291\" data-end=\"3323\">Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3323\" data-end=\"3373\">Window cutouts, Thumb notches, Slits<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3373\" data-end=\"3423\">Retail Boxes, Food Trays, Gift Sets<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3424\" data-end=\"3710\">\n<td data-start=\"3424\" data-end=\"3450\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3426\" data-end=\"3438\">Printing<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3450\" data-end=\"3528\">Full-color CMYK, PMS, or B\/W<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3576\">14pt to 24pt thickness<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3609\">Offset or Digital<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3609\" data-end=\"3660\">High-res logos, QR codes, Barcodes<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3660\" data-end=\"3710\">Branding sleeves for plain boxes or trays<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3997\">\n<td data-start=\"3711\" data-end=\"3737\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3713\" data-end=\"3728\">Die-Cutting<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3737\" data-end=\"3815\">Custom shapes and edges available<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3815\" data-end=\"3863\">Kraft or White Inside<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"3863\" data-end=\"3896\">Clean-edge cutting<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3896\" data-end=\"3947\">Rounded corners, Foldable or glue-free designs<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"3947\" data-end=\"3997\">Cosmetics, Apparel, Chocolates, Media Packs<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3998\" data-end=\"4284\">\n<td data-start=\"3998\" data-end=\"4024\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4000\" data-end=\"4017\">Sleeve Styles<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4024\" data-end=\"4102\">Closed-loop, Open-ended, or Locking Tabs<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4102\" data-end=\"4150\">Eco and food-safe board available<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4150\" data-end=\"4182\">Matte or soft-touch lamination<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4182\" data-end=\"4233\">Easy slide-on and wrap-around fit<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4233\" data-end=\"4284\">Food products, Soaps, Supplements<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4285\" data-end=\"4572\">\n<td data-start=\"4285\" data-end=\"4311\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4287\" data-end=\"4307\">Minimum Quantity<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4311\" data-end=\"4389\">Starts from 100 units<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4389\" data-end=\"4437\">Low MOQ with bulk discounts<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4437\" data-end=\"4470\">Reorder available<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4470\" data-end=\"4521\">Fast production setup<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4521\" data-end=\"4572\">Product launches, Seasonal packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4573\" data-end=\"4859\">\n<td data-start=\"4573\" data-end=\"4599\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"4575\" data-end=\"4598\">Shipping &amp; Handling<\/strong><\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4599\" data-end=\"4677\">Flat-packed for storage; shipped assembled on request<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4677\" data-end=\"4725\">USA-wide production &amp; delivery<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"4725\" data-end=\"4757\">Free Shipping Options<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4757\" data-end=\"4808\">Rush orders available<\/td>\n<td data-col-size=\"md\" data-start=\"4808\" data-end=\"4859\">Retail Brands, Small Businesses, Startups<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<div class=\"sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none\">\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<hr data-start=\"4861\" data-end=\"4864\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"4866\" data-end=\"4906\">How to Make Packaging Sleeves with Us<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4908\" data-end=\"5046\">If you&#8217;re wondering <strong data-start=\"4928\" data-end=\"4961\">how to make packaging sleeves<\/strong> with custom designs, our process is simple and supported by a dedicated design team.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"5048\" data-end=\"5077\">Easy Steps to Get Started<\/h3>\n<ol data-start=\"5079\" data-end=\"5314\">\n<li data-start=\"5079\" data-end=\"5126\">\n<p data-start=\"5082\" data-end=\"5126\">Choose your box size and sleeve dimensions<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5127\" data-end=\"5173\">\n<p data-start=\"5130\" data-end=\"5173\">Select your preferred material and finish<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5174\" data-end=\"5221\">\n<p data-start=\"5177\" data-end=\"5221\">Upload your logo, artwork, or product info<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5222\" data-end=\"5268\">\n<p data-start=\"5225\" data-end=\"5268\">Request free design mockups and approvals<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5269\" data-end=\"5314\">\n<p data-start=\"5272\" data-end=\"5314\">Confirm your order and get fast delivery<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"5316\" data-end=\"5432\">We make it easy to scale your packaging across multiple product lines using consistent sleeve templates and layouts.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"5434\" data-end=\"5437\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"5439\" data-end=\"5473\">Fast Delivery and Customization<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5475\" data-end=\"5724\">If you&#8217;re looking for <strong data-start=\"5497\" data-end=\"5541\">custom cardboard sleeve packaging nearby<\/strong>, our production is U.S.-based for fast delivery and minimal lead times. Whether you\u2019re a growing startup or an established brand, we provide flexible options without long wait times.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5726\" data-end=\"5744\">You\u2019ll also enjoy:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"5746\" data-end=\"5913\">\n<li data-start=\"5746\" data-end=\"5777\">\n<p data-start=\"5748\" data-end=\"5777\">Free shipping on all orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5778\" data-end=\"5815\">\n<p data-start=\"5780\" data-end=\"5815\">Digital mockups before production<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5816\" data-end=\"5863\">\n<p data-start=\"5818\" data-end=\"5863\">No die or setup charges on standard sleeves<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5864\" data-end=\"5913\">\n<p data-start=\"5866\" data-end=\"5913\">Reorder-friendly file storage for consistency<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5915\" data-end=\"6001\">Sleeves are also easier to update seasonally without changing your base box structure.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"6003\" data-end=\"6006\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"6008\" data-end=\"6057\">Cardboard Boxes for Various Functions<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"6059\" data-end=\"6328\">If you&#8217;re packaging products check out our <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-for-specific-uses\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"6115\" data-end=\"6238\"><strong data-start=\"6116\" data-end=\"6153\">Cardboard Boxes For Specific Uses<\/strong><\/a> section. This includes options for food packaging, gifting, mailers, cosmetics, and more.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6330\" data-end=\"6437\">It helps you select packaging not just by style, but also by what it\u2019s meant to protect, carry, or display.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"6439\" data-end=\"6442\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"6444\" data-end=\"6477\">Finishes and Optional Features<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"6479\" data-end=\"6498\">Coating Choices<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"6500\" data-end=\"6616\">\n<li data-start=\"6500\" data-end=\"6538\">\n<p data-start=\"6502\" data-end=\"6538\">Gloss for sharp and bright visuals<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6539\" data-end=\"6576\">\n<p data-start=\"6541\" data-end=\"6576\">Matte for a softer, smoother feel<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6577\" data-end=\"6616\">\n<p data-start=\"6579\" data-end=\"6616\">Spot UV to highlight logos or names<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"6618\" data-end=\"6636\">Add-On Options<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"6638\" data-end=\"6783\">\n<li data-start=\"6638\" data-end=\"6677\">\n<p data-start=\"6640\" data-end=\"6677\">Die-cut windows for product viewing<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6678\" data-end=\"6712\">\n<p data-start=\"6680\" data-end=\"6712\">Thumb notches for easy removal<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6713\" data-end=\"6748\">\n<p data-start=\"6715\" data-end=\"6748\">Lock tabs for closure stability<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6749\" data-end=\"6783\">\n<p data-start=\"6751\" data-end=\"6783\">Inside printing for added detail<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"6785\" data-end=\"6788\" \/>\n<p data-start=\"6790\" data-end=\"6987\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"6790\" data-end=\"6834\">Need printed cardboard sleeves at scale?<\/strong> Contact us today to get a free quote for <strong data-start=\"6876\" data-end=\"6906\">cardboard sleeve packaging<\/strong>\u2014customized for your brand, delivered fast, and priced right for wholesale needs.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/article>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes for wholesale cardboard sleeve packaging. We offer coating options like Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV, along with free design support and shipping. Enjoy fast turnaround times and a range of premium material and printing options to ensure your packaging stands out. Contact us today for a quote.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2418,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[182],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2286","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-for-specific-uses","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is opt